cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PaperAudit in your research or software, please cite this repository."
title: "PaperAudit: Privacy-first DOCX preflight for research manuscripts"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PaperAudit contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wcwce00-glitch/PaperAudit"
url: "https://wcwce00-glitch.github.io/PaperAudit/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  PaperAudit is a browser-based, open-source preflight assistant for research
  manuscripts in Word DOCX format. It checks selected caption/reference patterns
  and supported embedded image dimensions, and it emphasizes source-traceable
  findings and explicit review states where automatic verification is unreliable.
